<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">MY FOOD DIARY</view><view class="profile-heading"><view class="profile-avatar">😋</view><view><view class="title">食光体验官</view><view class="subtitle">生活的热爱，藏在一日三餐里</view></view></view><view class="pill">✦ 今天也有好好吃饭</view></view><view class="stats panel"><view bindtap="openFavorites"><view class="stat-number">{{favoriteCount}}</view><view class="muted">我的收藏 →</view></view><view><view class="stat-number">{{reviewCount}}</view><view class="muted">发表评价</view></view></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">我的探店足迹</text><text class="muted">每一餐都值得记录</text></view><view wx:for="{{reviews}}" wx:key="id" class="panel diary" data-id="{{item.foodId}}" bindtap="openFood"><view class="row"><text class="diary-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="accent">↗</text></view><view class="diary-stars"><text wx:for="{{item.stars}}" wx:for-item="star" wx:key="value" class="star {{star.filled?'lit':''}}">★</text><text class="muted"> · {{item.nickname}}</text></view><view class="body-text">{{item.content}}</view><view class="diary-time muted">{{item.time}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!reviews.length}}" class="empty"><text class="empty-art">📝</text><view class="empty-title">你的美食日记，等你开篇</view><view class="subtitle">去喜欢的店铺，写下第一条评价吧</view><button class="primary" bindtap="goHome">开启探店之旅 →</button></view><view class="footer-note">食光探店 v1.0 · 数据仅保存在当前设备</view></view>
